Usage: qodercli plugins list [options]

List installed plugins.

Options:
  --json                        Output as JSON. (default: false)
  --available                   Include available plugins from marketplaces
                                (requires --json). (default: false)
  -o, --output-format <format>  The format of the CLI output. (choices: "text",
                                "json")
  --plugin-dir <dirs...>        Additional plugin directories to scan.
  -h, --help                    display help for command
